Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:04.98,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Headmistress Olivia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.92,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,It's been too long, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:45.00,Ep_Title,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}The Night Before the Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:55.56,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help the other day, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:56.79,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:59.92,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, \NHeadmistress Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:03.57,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I'm an elf born of this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:07.68,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I left the forest to live in \Nthe outside world ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.19,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,but I rushed here when I heard the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:12.00,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.68,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,So you already knew Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:18.18,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,May we proceed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:25.96,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,We have no intention of waiting out \Nthe three days this Georg laid out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.90,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, as the sun is halfway to its peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:32.98,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,we will gather our forces \Nstill capable of fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.96,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,destroy the portal to the demonic realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:38.57,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,and send them packing from the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:45.59,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,They can only stay here because of \Nthe energy the portal provides them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.59,0:02:47.06,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:51.43,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,If we destroy the portal, they'll \Nbe unable to sustain their presence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.56,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,or return here afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:03:00.10,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Then the forest will be able to cleanse itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.22,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We understand your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:07.02,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We've spoken to Gio about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:11.24,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,and we intend to continue fighting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:18.45,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Hm... But we can't ask outsiders \Nto provide even further aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:21.54,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Are you underestimating us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:25.85,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,is what I'd like to say, but you \Nclearly possess formidable strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:32.35,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,If anything, we should be bowing our heads \Nto the ground to ask for your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:35.50,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Dio, I get that it's pathetic of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:40.62,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,but we're in a situation where \Nwe need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.49,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:47.41,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,I agree with Vlaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:50.35,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,Dolan, Christina, and Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:53.60,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,We feel incredibly fortunate \Nto hear your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.62,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,Please lend us your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:04:01.64,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Dio, I promise you that these \Nthree are highly reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:05.70,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I have requested help from \Nthe kingdom, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:06.63,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Oho?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:09.63,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,They'll take a little while to arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:14.39,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,but they'll provide a way to reclaim \Nthe forest even if we were to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:17.37,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:22.29,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Dolan, Celina, and Christina, \Nwe're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:27.03,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I can feel their strong desire \Nto protect their forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:31.38,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I want to fulfill that desire \Nany way I possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:36.08,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Of course. We'll do everything in our \Npower to live up to your expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.70,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:41.07,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,We swear to rid the forest of those fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.51,0:04:53.39,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Damn that superhuman girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:56.53,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Those detestable fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:05:00.35,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,And how dare that surface flower scar me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:06.03,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,You're going too far, Geolude and Raflasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:10.78,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,These soldiers don't grow \Non trees, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:14.53,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Georg, why won't you say \Nsomething to stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.53,0:05:16.42,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Let them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:21.79,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Their spirits must be raging \Nbefore the upcoming battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:25.04,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Yes, but so is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:31.63,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,That lamia lass may be too young for \Nher scales to have hardened yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.55,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,but she has potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:37.80,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I very much took a liking \Nto that Dolan guy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:42.69,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I am convinced we can have the kind of \Nbattle I haven't tasted in a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:46.13,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Oh? I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:51.25,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I thought you were unable to enjoy a fight \Noutside the celestial and demonic realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:51.70,Main - Top,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:55.33,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:56.40,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:06:03.21,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,The combat capabilities, mana, and \Nfighting spirit he showed in our battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.85,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,There is no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:10.42,Italics,GEORG,0,0,0,,Back when I was part of the \Nwar god Ardes's army...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:17.37,Flashback,CELESTIAL1,0,0,0,,Stupid fallen gods. \NThey've created such annoying monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.30,Flashback,PASTGEORG,0,0,0,,Even we have to gang up on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:23.89,Flashback,PASTGEORG,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Ardes on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.66,Flashback,PASTGEORG,0,0,0,,We must head there at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:27.85,Flashback,PASTGEORG,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.56,Flashback,CELESTIAL2,0,0,0,,I've heard that Goddess Myrale summoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.96,Flashback,CELESTIAL2,0,0,0,,He must be on his way to Ardes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:44.33,Flashback,CELESTIAL1,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Georg?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:50.13,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,The ancient dragon who once demolished \Nand massacred the demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:54.27,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,and made them tremble at the \Nvery mention of his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:56.44,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,the alpha and the omega...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:07:00.10,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,And he has now become a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:04.63,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Either way, it's sure to be a battle \Nthat gets the blood boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:07.65,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Hurry to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:12.38,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,It has truly been eons since I \Nhave anticipated a battle so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.98,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,What do you want so late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.85,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.61,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:38.04,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm not in a very good mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:42.11,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Who knows what I might do \Nif you get too close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:48.48,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I just wanted to take care of something \Nbothering me before tomorrow's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.76,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Am I not good enough to fight with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:57.35,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Hey! Didn't you hear me tell \Nyou not to get close to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:01.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I did, which is why I did it with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.60,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You're a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.72,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.86,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,So much so that I've gotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:14.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Your wound hasn't healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:19.53,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,The ones Raflasia gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.73,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You see right through me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.30,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Mind if I take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.67,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,It's nothing to concern yourself over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:33.01,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were \Nwalking around in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.85,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll purify it with some of my life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:39.09,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Please don't resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:50.42,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder \Nif you're really human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:54.67,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you thought of \Nme as one, albeit a little unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.68,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Were you grieving them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:14.07,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Raflasia killed some really \Nbeautiful spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:18.64,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,None of them deserved to \Ngo out the way they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.00,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:30.83,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,That's why I can't stand it. \NI have to get revenge for their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.40,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,And I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:37.46,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Will you let me help you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:49.03,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You really are strange... \Nor "unusual," as you would have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.72,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Thank you for healing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:10:00.22,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm surprised how glad I am that we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.47,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:17.67,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:20.02,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You're here too, Fio and Merl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.59,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,I brought you some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:25.28,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,It's floral tea, with added nectar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.28,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,Fio's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:29.52,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,We've started before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.78,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Here, this is dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.28,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thanks, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Did you bring this too, Fio?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:42.28,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Yep. Can't have you fighting \Non an empty stomach, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.26,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,It's really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:46.37,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thanks, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:55.75,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Ah, a very comforting meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:58.44,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I could eat this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:01.58,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:04.94,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Christina practically inhaled \Nit in no time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:08.19,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,That was unbecoming of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:15.18,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you can eat so \Nmuch and still stay so slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.60,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I don't gain weight easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:21.69,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Plus, I exercise as much as I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:28.47,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Still, you're slim in the waist \Nand stacked where it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:32.09,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,As a fellow lady, I am super envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.50,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:42.59,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,If you ask me, you're both plenty \Nstacked and have great curves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:52.85,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Dolan, could you stop \Nstaring for one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.58,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You're a boy of age, \Nso I can understand why,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.90,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,but please pick a better time and place...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:02.51,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't have any \Ndirty thoughts in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:07.81,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that Fio \Nhad no need to envy anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:14.15,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Well, I guess \NI'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:18.31,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it'll look like \Nwe're bullying you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:21.58,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,Do you want to bully Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:23.49,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,You're reading too much into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:28.63,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should've discussed \Nthis without male presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:31.14,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's continue some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.65,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,We have an early start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:36.90,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,We should turn in for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:37.53,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:39.92,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'll clean up, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:40.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:23.30,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:27.56,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.59,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You couldn't sleep, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.05,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:49.59,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yeah, I couldn't sleep,\N so I stepped out for some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:51.66,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,So we had the same thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:57.24,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Look. I only found it a while ago, \Nbut it's already my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:01.49,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll make you feel better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:04.21,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Your favorite, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:06.25,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:19.01,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,It's amazing how beautiful \Nthis elven village is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:23.43,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,The moonlight trickles \Ngently through the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:30.83,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Only made possible because they've lived \Nin harmony in nature for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:36.40,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can hear clanking in the \Ndistance when I focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:37.72,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:43.87,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,The smiths must be working all \Nnight to prepare for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.65,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,They want to help their \Nfriends win the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:52.50,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry for \Nthoughtlessly calling it cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:57.17,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No, that was insensitive of me to bring up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.90,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.78,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This scenery really soothes the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:13.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:22.12,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina, people may call me strange, \Nbut I'm not entirely unperceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:24.17,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? Where is this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:32.63,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I've noticed your anxiety ever since we \Ncame to the village after that battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.09,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:38.69,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I dragged you into this mess despite \Nknowing you're unsuited to warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.19,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:49.49,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,This isn't because I'm scared \Nof fighting or anything, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:51.52,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:03.32,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I could have killed that demon back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.86,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,All I had to do was squeeze \Nhim tight with Jalaam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:12.64,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,But I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:16.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Even though so many of the \Nelves and Diadora got hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:20.41,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and even though I know \Nthat demon was a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:26.72,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I couldn't bring myself to end his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.58,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and I froze in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.74,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm a terrible lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:37.68,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I know I have to change, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:45.02,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yeah, I always thought lamia \Nwere more cold-blooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:49.53,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Until I met you, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:50.43,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:17:01.12,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If you were the type of cold-blooded \Nlamia told of in legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:05.71,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have thought of \Nwelcoming you into the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You have no need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:15.42,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I prefer you just the way you \Nare, a kind and gentle soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:19.12,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Come on, Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Here, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:24.42,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:29.40,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Is that... a magic crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:31.85,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:37.31,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,What is it? It has several times \Nthe energy of a magic crystal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:41.95,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It's my favorite—and its \Nproduction method is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:47.27,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I crafted it hoping that \Nit would keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.38,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And it will do just that \Nin tomorrow's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:59.32,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,So trust me, and you'll \Nhave nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.23,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.29,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Ch-Chris?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:22.29,Main,CHRIS,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold being \Noutdoors this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:23.84,Main,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.17,Main,CHRIS,0,0,0,,It's unfair that you're leaving \Nme out of this spectacular view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:32.03,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.39,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Let's take it in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:53.01,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,How I want to protect \Nthis beautiful village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.39,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:02.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, Christina... I won't waver anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:04.65,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:10.92,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I want to help Gio, Fio, Merl, \Nand all the other villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:14.67,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,That's what I want to do most right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.03,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,So I won't waver this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.44,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:23.31,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I'll cut down evil to help everyone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:27.56,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Chris!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.35,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.04,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,She really must've been stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:43.93,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.22,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, I have a weird question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:52.33,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Have you heard the word "superhuman" before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:58.32,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No, can't say that I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:04.12,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,No? That's fine. Forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:15.51,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Fellow warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:19.27,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,You who live with the blessings \Nof the Forest of Ente!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:24.12,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,With the appearance of those \Nwretched demons in these lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.86,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,many of our brethren have \Nfallen prey to them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:30.98,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,and become part of the forest, \Nwhich in turn has been defiled by the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:32.98,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,and is screaming out in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.61,0:20:36.20,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I will not forget their lamentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.14,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I will not forget their hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.64,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I will not forget their wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:48.63,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Now is the time to avenge their \Ndeaths and let our righteous rage,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:51.83,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,as we bring judgment \Ndown upon those fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:55.30,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:58.34,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Our target, the demonic portal,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:03.75,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,has one main gate and three \Nauxiliary gates surrounding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.50,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,The elven warriors led by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:10.43,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,the beastkin squad led by Vlaic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.47,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,and the arachne squad led by Alsienne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:14.05,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,will handle each of those gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:17.15,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Captain Gio's squad will be our ranger unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:22.67,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,The main objective will be to deliver \Nyou to the main gate at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:29.08,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Elf, beastkin, arachne, spirit, \Nand all forest dwellers alike
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.86,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,are staking everything on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.55,0:21:35.04,Flashback,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Please, save the Forest of Ente!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:41.36,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:45.17,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,The demons are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:48.66,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Celina?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:51.01,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Go ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:53.32,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'll help Gio's squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.70,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,What? Why would you go off by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.95,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, Chris, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.97,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I have nothing holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:07.20,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Fine. Don't push yourself, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:08.54,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:24.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here comes Celina!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:59.91,Next_Episode,SIGN,0,0,0,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:07.83,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,This week's lucky item is a bracelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:09.69,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Look forward to next time!
